{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique atmosphere of Bubble Ghost Remake with its official soundtrack, composed by Fran Romguer. This collection includes all the main melodies from the video game, as well as exclusive tracks composed especially for this album, which you won\u2019t hear during gameplay. From melancholic themes to vibrant, mysterious pieces, this soundtrack lets you relive the magic of the game anytime. Perfect for fans of the title and for those who appreciate music and storytelling through sound. Experience the story of Heinrich Von Schinker in a musical way! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698950?t=1748253830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698950?t=1748253830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698950/1aa175e8419ef2492286869610adcb28499f8cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748253830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698950/1aa175e8419ef2492286869610adcb28499f8cb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748253830","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the unique atmosphere of Bubble Ghost Remake with its official soundtrack, composed by Fran Romguer. This collection includes all the main melodies from the video game, as well as exclusive tracks composed especially for this album, which you won\u2019t hear during gameplay. From melancholic themes to vibrant, mysterious pieces, this soundtrack lets you relive the magic of the game anytime. Perfect for fans of the title and for those who appreciate music and storytelling through sound. Experience the story of Heinrich Von Schinker in a musical way! </p>","developers":["Nakama Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2412240","name":"Bubble Ghost Remake"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com